%U A399275 16520499729800317448,659971394056032065334,26364955549479696638146,1053243954814182246403992,42075657069625367494335746
%N A399275 Number of perfect matchings of the 6 X 2n grid graph embedded on the Klein bottle.
%C A399275 The characteristic polynomial x^6 - 48*x^5 + 336*x^4 - 582*x^3 + 336*x^2 - 48*x + 1 is palindromic. Using y = x + 1/x, it factors as (y - 6)*(y^2 - 42*y + 81), giving y-values 6 and 21 +- 6*sqrt(10). The dominant root is approximately 39.949.
%H A399275 Paolo Xausa, <a href="/A399275/b399275.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..600</a> (terms 0..30 from Jean Lauro Muller).
%H A399275 Jean Lauro Muller, <a href="/A399275/a399275.py.txt">Python program for computing the sequence</a>
%H A399275 <a href="/index/Rec#order_06">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (48,-336,582,-336,48,-1).
%F A399275 a(n) = 48*a(n-1) - 336*a(n-2) + 582*a(n-3) - 336*a(n-4) + 48*a(n-5) - a(n-6) for n >= 7, with a(0) = 1, a(1) = 54, a(2) = 1666, a(3) = 64152, a(4) = 2549186, a(5) = 101757654, a(6) = 4064620168.
%F A399275 G.f.: 1 + 2*x*(27 - 463*x + 1164*x^2 - 881*x^3 + 165*x^4 - 4*x^5)/((1 - 6*x + x^2)*(1 - 42*x + 83*x^2 - 42*x^3 + x^4)).
%F A399275 a(n) = Product_{m=1..3} Product_{k=1..n} ( 4*sin(Pi*(4*k-1)/(4*n))^2 + 4*sin(Pi*(2*m-1)/6)^2 ).
%e A399275 For n=1, the 6 X 2 grid on the Klein bottle has a(1) = 54 perfect matchings (multigraph convention).
%t A399275 LinearRecurrence[{48, -336, 582, -336, 48, -1}, {1, 54, 1666, 64152, 2549186, 101757654, 4064620168}, 20] (* _Paolo Xausa_, Sep 02 2026 *)
